      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.84,
      "end_seconds": 32.21,
      "duration_seconds": 16.37,
      "text": "Um, so... pain much worse than it looks. That's why I came. I told myself I'd wait and see, and and here I am. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
