      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.33,
      "end_seconds": 43.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "It's been like this since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.7,
      "end_seconds": 47.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Ah. How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.21,
      "end_seconds": 50.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "It's, It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.28,
      "end_seconds": 53.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.51,
      "end_seconds": 63.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Dark blisters goes along with it, most of the time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.56,
      "end_seconds": 84.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
