      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.87,
      "end_seconds": 140.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.23,
      "end_seconds": 144.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Have you noticed cut or insect bite?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.57,
      "end_seconds": 150.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "no cut or insect bite, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.33,
      "end_seconds": 154.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.66,
      "end_seconds": 159.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "right, I move fine otherwise"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.08,
      "end_seconds": 179.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.41,
      "end_seconds": 195.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.93,
      "end_seconds": 226.58,
      "duration_seconds": 11.65,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 29.4, height 152 centimetres. And weight 68 kilos, BP is 109 over 72, saturation 95 percent, pulse 94."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.95,
      "end_seconds": 231.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.53,
      "end_seconds": 233.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.26,
      "end_seconds": 256.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "the skin on your leg is dusky with blisters and is very tender, and you are feverish"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.96,
      "end_seconds": 279.53,
      "duration_seconds": 19.57,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.55,
      "end_seconds": 284.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.43,
      "end_seconds": 301.08,
      "duration_seconds": 11.65,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review is my leading thought, not anything worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.24,
      "end_seconds": 344.8,
      "duration_seconds": 30.56,
      "text": "let's book an urgent surgical review to look into possible necrotising infection. I'd like to arrange urgent blood tests for severe skin infection. I am sending you to hospital now, do not wait. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. The thing that would worry me is if you cannot go now. If that happens, go to emergency. I'll want another look straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.34,
      "end_seconds": 348.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "I can manage that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.55,
      "end_seconds": 352.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.02,
      "end_seconds": 358.8,
